{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_017_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3a0288675877306bed08889e07d1ed82733f73eaf7b058998c94dd9bdf0558f1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:913fa7a82bcfe94a407ffb47ef554e391f7c7565cfe851d05f5d3c3c069cf0d9",
      "text": "彩的休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2704755c3bc7fed5c3f05398897d91f882a9862595764695ab2b2ba2e188bf5f",
      "text": "我回来啦喵～♪\n九郎君，吾辈的点心在哪喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d3b2cf991407fab7ce5d282ca2b8b7ba77eea18c618a4bfafebc6a79a234297",
      "text": "猫柳先生，欢迎回来。\n事不宜迟，请坐在那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce07267353b675dbe720e73b3a55cd9ef104c2372f9e91a68a0b8bd4fb985c09",
      "text": "喵？吾辈明明什么都还没做就开启生气模式了吗！？\n明明也没迟到，为什么会这样喵！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66702ca8419cb6d1c0bc9b73fc2655d703429328f22a6deadc74122fdc32985b",
      "text": "九郎酱，太僵硬啦。\n小伙子都误会了不是吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e45061222423d60de7a35fc92ab87a6e72a71012495b871049bd7d7f0d16ba42",
      "text": "实在抱歉，我对这种事情\n不太习惯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8183d116dfa20e7e4008a0d68038e4347073fae0412087adf6f591b3bf25b39",
      "text": "翔真先生，赶快把那个交给他吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6a7432a319f87f48cf935c10ae2a007691da266013b2ae01fb698b522bf4429",
      "text": "给，拿好。这是我们为小伙子你筹办的\n生日会邀请函哦。能收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4fb00c2d8a8c9df87d674599da44554f452e411761fbbc291463a9200939332",
      "text": "桐生先生？……整个人愣住了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acc4962945a4a899a906c740925ac0753601f7d4fb86178b7dd168b3ef2b628a",
      "text": "没想到会让你这么惊讶。请问这\n算是感到高兴的意思吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24cf2e01721eb6bbbe241f7ea1e106a3060a8153cb98d4ca69c37b2e21fec652",
      "text": "是的！惊喜成功了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_02_1_2_017_02:1_2_017_02_c:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48c0896cdbe5a1b2601de5c6b680602baac44254b7c09f03bf807f5a2d6f6208",
      "text": "看来悄悄准备还是有意义的。\n在邀请函上写着的时间，记得来事务所哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
